<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body>
    <table
      style="width: 100%; float: left; border: 5px solid #0000000d; padding: 0px 10px;"
      border="0"
    >
      <tr>
        <td>
          <img
           src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_HEADER}}" style="width: 100%;"
          />
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <h1 style="text-align:center">DISBURSAL LETTER</h1>

          <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

          <p>Loan Number: {{loanNo}}</p>

          <p>
            Your loan for Rs {{disbursalAmount}} is disbursed
          </p>

          <p>
            We are pleased to have disbursed a loan for Rs.
            {{disbursalAmount}}
            @ {{roi}}% interest per day for a period of
            {{tenure}} days on the terms and conditions agreed by you.
          </p>

          <p>
            Your repayment amount is Rs. {{repayment}}
          </p>

          <p>
            Repaying this loan on time will keep your record straight, not only
            with us but also in the Bureaus. We are always there with you, and
            you can take another loan from us immediately after repayment.
          </p>

          <p>Best regards,</p>
          <p>Team {{COMPANY_NAME}}</p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
         <td><img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_FOOTER}}" style="width: 100%;"></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
